  "title": "Robust RPC Bundle Adjustment and Dense Stereo Matching for Multi-Date Satellite Imagery",
  "summary": "The proposed approaches enhance the accuracy and robustness of satellite imagery refinement using a combination of learned local feature matching and global image descriptors, addressing challenges related to seasonal, illumination, and land-cover changes. SeasonStereo and RPC refinement improve performance in diachronic settings by leveraging synthetic image pairs with controlled appearance variation and zero-shot geometric priors.",
